{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b3157144bc8cad0986398f582e260594ee75d1d97ba4021b30f1f2beea659fb0", "ja": "（麗花と貴音が出演した怪盗が主役のドラマが、\n『視聴者が選ぶベストドラマ』に選ばれた……！）", "zh": "（丽花和贵音出演的、以怪盗为主角的电视剧，\n被选为“观众票选最佳电视剧”了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "a87a399aebeeb442bb7e3600a67d68b6e4e0a5f094a5bde784f56b2f60802c92", "ja": "やったやった～！　私たちのドラマが一番なんですね！\nルーキー怪盗と大怪盗の協力作戦、大成功～♪", "zh": "太好啦太好啦～！我们的电视剧拿了第一名呢！\n菜鸟怪盗和大怪盗的联合作战，大成功～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "8af30ec7e63fcecb56f51238ccb4af6e990c9550e4fdb6e7aaa817163ac1b6f8", "ja": "ええ。真、喜ばしいことですね。しかも、\nとろふぃーまでいただけるとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "是的。真，真是令人欣喜。而且，没想到连奖杯都能拿到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1003_p", "source_sha256": "17cce5e2f71ecff55b637c6768bf40150f46a85e9bf6590af9991afb33a1e943", "ja": "ああ、この表彰式も番組内で放送されるそうだ。\n麗花、貴音……改めて、おめでとう！", "zh": "啊，听说这次颁奖仪式也会在节目中播出。\n丽花、贵音……再次恭喜你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "689d8e315b4bf856c4914602b1bc245d59ba98124376f2e7c57db37fa479964e", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\n貴音ちゃんと一緒に手に入れた、最高のお宝ですね！", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生！\n这是和贵音一起得到的最棒的宝物呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "09675cf11e34c8ad7a0d5d020e93746a9a02bbee1a32b3c3a5477071912a5394", "ja": "とっても嬉しいので……\nこのトロフィーは、劇場に隠しちゃいましょう～！", "zh": "因为特别开心……\n我们把这个奖杯藏在剧场里吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1006_p", "source_sha256": "fe012f6f3292fabcb55b9c55742d007d9250fc8080c959af3e5c1aefbb3f1fa4", "ja": "え？　劇場に、隠す？　……な、なんで？", "zh": "诶？要藏在剧场里？……为、为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1007_008tak", "source_sha256": "43dcaa696f3b6fcf7c9d5f6aa6ab55ac872f7dbb87f6073b8e3117f9c9cc544a", "ja": "ふむ……。{$P$}、もしかすると\n麗花は、宝探しをしたいのかもしれません。", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}，说不定丽花是想寻宝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1008_p", "source_sha256": "53f7cd7c8c011e1cfb170f84beebd154dcfa9f7304d75a8a39e382fc79cedd68", "ja": "宝探しを？　劇場でか？", "zh": "寻宝？在剧场里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d6d5fffab3b1ff02d5f8e681d7fb20dca093b9f924d3142eb311fca21481eb59", "ja": "（あの短時間で、貴音は麗花の考えを察したのか？\nさ、さすがだ……）", "zh": "（贵音竟然在那么短的时间里就察觉到了丽花的想法吗？不、不愧是她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "d35c00c6062b09b876601b6f73f1b7cf6071254a589b7419aa012697237bd746", "ja": "さて。とろふぃーを隠す役目は、非常に重要です。\nここは美咲嬢に依頼するのがよいかもしれませんね。", "zh": "那么，藏奖杯的任务可是非常重要的。这里或许还是拜托美咲小姐比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "45a880856954c2cddd361f46115c4b438b43b76a4165149fb63686b1d843409d", "ja": "貴音ちゃん、ナイスアイディア♪　美咲さんにお願い\nして、絶対見つからない場所に隠してもらおっか！", "zh": "贵音，主意不错♪　拜托美咲把它藏到绝对不会被发现的地方吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1012_008tak", "source_sha256": "7943aec76f28b6b17dba98003b041e12509322ab73d1e5250ac9a91200c4f328", "ja": "ふふっ。困難なみっしょんとなりそうですが、\n探し出す甲斐があるでしょう。私も今から楽しみです。", "zh": "呵呵，看来会是一项艰难的任务，不过也值得我们把它找出来。我现在就开始期待了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a59945fae4379dd5f2bf1c94414ae8b3391120b3e284eb66373bb9583895909f", "ja": "お、おいおい……大丈夫か？\n折角もらったのに……失くしても知らないぞ？", "zh": "喂、喂喂……没事吧？\n好不容易才拿到的……要是弄丢了我可不管啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "b398e518ee5cbefb56b1dbf1e7d238de24500ea5de424764325ef606abd055c3", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ！　そうならないように、\n{$P$}さんも、頑張ってくださいね♪", "zh": "没事的啦！为了不变成那样，\n{$P$}先生也要加油哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8db23048173010b12f6424b0abfdde1ceb115ec783fc5656cf0c9551a2a27532", "ja": "そ、そうか。俺も一緒に探すの前提か……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。原来前提是我也要一起找啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "8fc50e91286b90e73d23f2239b0f7a82892bcd760e8bf605f2da6cce3340d061", "ja": "はい♪　だって{$P$}さんも\n私と貴音ちゃんの怪盗団の一員ですから。そうだよね？", "zh": "是呀♪因为{$P$}先生也是我和贵音组成的怪盗团成员嘛。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "816a5dee68beffa7420484dd452d93b007a5be85eb1ce50ce5076d9d3a75044b", "ja": "ええ、その通りです。{$P$}も、\n私達と共に、再びとろふぃーを手にする喜びを、ぜひ。", "zh": "是的，正是如此。也请{$P$}和我们一起，再次享受获得奖杯的喜悦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9927ea0a7ece43ff8dc0326108288f051300617584590524519449d438a6c515", "ja": "ははっ、なるほどな。そういうことなら、\n宝探しを手伝わせてくれ。三人で一緒に見つけよう！", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。既然这样，就让我来帮忙寻宝吧。我们三个人一起找出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "c322bc1e96d57494e60ed08e547a4004df22347d3ca65399533672df893d08a3", "ja": "私たちが受け取った、嬉しくてキラキラした気持ち……\nしっかり体験してくださいね♪", "zh": "我们所收到的，那份喜悦而闪闪发光的心情……\n请好好亲身体验哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1020_008tak", "source_sha256": "449771e23cbc630c8e8ce5c2d0eae7e6864c7c9eacaf473e54a0d696e47246b1", "ja": "{$P$}の尽力により得られた宝です。\nより思い出を深めるのも、また一興かと。", "zh": "这是因{$P$}的努力而获得的宝物。\n再进一步加深这份回忆，想必也别有一番乐趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1021_p", "source_sha256": "53d0fc030ed7cca4cba40cb21c9c51da6586f780e68c3645f2c6250ac9920faf", "ja": "そうだな。よし、劇場に帰ったら探索開始だ！\n……っと、その前に青羽さんにお願いしないとな！", "zh": "没错。好，回到剧场后就开始探索吧！\n……等等，在那之前得先拜托青羽小姐才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0334_1022_p", "source_sha256": "dd74fde1ab347339119c3af6fc950c251ce52e96261605c718e92778f98658c8", "ja": "（麗花と貴音の怪盗業はもう少しだけ続きそうだな。\n……あとで青羽さんに、お手柔らかにと伝えておこう）", "zh": "（丽花和贵音的怪盗生涯似乎还会再持续一阵子。\n……之后还是拜托青羽小姐手下留情吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
